Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}但这不能证明你来自未来{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}That doesn't prove you're from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}好吧{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.42,0:15:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}这个周末，你哥哥马克{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}This weekend, your brother, Mark,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}那个讨厌鬼{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}who's a real pain in the ass...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}会从树上掉下来，摔断胳膊{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}...falls out of a tree and breaks his arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}好啊，不过只有等到那时候…。{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Yeah, but I won't know till then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我才能知道你说的是不是真的{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}if you're telling the truth or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.07,0:15:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}如果你能多待一会儿，就会看见我消失的{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Well, if you hang around long enough, you'll see me disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}可是你才刚来{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}But you just got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我还会再回来的{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I'll be back again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.48,0:15:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}会经常来{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Lots of times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}实际上…{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}In fact...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:16:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我下周二4点就会来{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}...I'll be back next Tuesday at 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}到时你能带几件衣服给我就太好了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}And it'd be great if, when you come then, you could bring me some clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}挑你爸爸那些不喜欢的衣服就行{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Something your dad won't miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.73,0:16:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}很高兴认识你{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}别为这个担心，都是很久以前的事了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Don't worry about that. It's been over for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}感觉有点奇怪{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}This is weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我从未认识过这个年纪的你{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I never knew you at this age. I mean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}一直以来我认识的你是一个…{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I've only known you as this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}成熟又稳重的男人{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}...mature, worldly person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}看来我得和自己竞争了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I'm competing against myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}知道吗{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}那时的你，是我心目中的完美男人{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}You were just kind of my perfect guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我还是有点不习惯{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I just can't get used to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我是说，我以前总是在等着你消失{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I mean, I just keep waiting for you to disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}会发生的，相信我{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Oh, it'll happen, believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.67,0:19:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}那是什么感觉？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}How's it feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我是说，我知道眼睁睁看着你消失的感觉{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I mean, I know what it's like to watch you go...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}但当时你自己是什么感觉？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}...but what's it like to always be the one that's going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}有时候，比如像是突然起身站起{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Sometimes it feels like you've stood up too quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}手脚会有些刺痛感，然后他们就不见了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Your hands and feet are tingling, and then they're not there at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}有时又像是突然走神了一下{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Sometimes it feels like your attention has wandered just for an instant...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.43,0:19:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}然后就赤身裸体站在某个地方了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}...then you're standing naked someplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.43,0:19:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}可能是去过的地方，也可能不是{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Maybe you've been there before, maybe you haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}你不知道这会持续多久{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}You don't know how long it's gonna last,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}所以不能一直待在那儿，你得找些衣服穿{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}so you start walking......till you find some clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}这样你看起来就像个正常人了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Then you seem just like everybody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}但是你在那里独自一人，无依无靠{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Except you're stranded and all alone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}只能等着自己再度消失{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}just waiting to disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}可是你能看见过去的人{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}But you get to see people from the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}逝去的人，比如说你母亲{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}People who are gone, like your mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}对，但关键是…{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Yeah, but the thing is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}你无法改变他们的命运{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}you can't change what happens to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我试过，可发生过的还是会发生{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I've tried. It just happens anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.43,0:20:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}这是查莉丝{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}This is Charisse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.43,0:20:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我的室友兼闺蜜{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}My roommate and my best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}同时也是今晚的大厨{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}And our excellent cook for tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.03,0:20:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}因为我不会做饭{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Because I don't cook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.80,0:20:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}你别在意这个{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Well, you should know that going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}她是个好女孩，但连烤面包都不会{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}She's a lovely girl, but she can't cook toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}戈麦斯？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Gomez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}全名是戈莫林斯基{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Yeah, short for Gomolinski.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}It's really nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.18,0:20:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}不，其实我们不是很想见你{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}We didn't wanna meet you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.51,0:20:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}但这好像是见到克莱儿的唯一方法{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}but seems to be the only way to catch a glimpse of Clare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}别理戈麦斯{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Please ignore Gomez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}来点葡萄酒？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Do you want some wine? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:20:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}谢谢，不用了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:20:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}那喝点水吧{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Do you want some water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.98,0:21:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}好啊{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Yeah, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.19,0:21:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}你可没告诉我他这么帅{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}You didn't tell me how cute he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.39,0:21:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}也没多帅，话也不多{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}He's not that cute. Doesn't talk much either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}除了知道他是个图书馆管理员{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I couldn't get anything out of him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}其他什么都没问出来{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}except he's a librarian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}也许你该停止审问他{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Well, maybe if you would stop interrogating him....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}这么多年来你一直没交男朋友{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}You never had a boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.27,0:21:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}但突然就跟他在一起了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}You spend every minute with the guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我只是想搞清楚原因{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Wondering what the draw is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}别烦她了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Leave her alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}她跟你我一样都是成年人{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}She's codependent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}你认为她就不该有感情生活？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}You thought she was gonna dodge that bullet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我只是觉得他没那么帅{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I just think he's not that cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}现在能放土豆了吗？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}All right, so can we put the potatoes in yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.18,0:21:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}还是要等到菜都熟透了之后再放？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Or do you wanna wait until the vegetables are done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}平底锅呢？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Where's the pan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我哪知道？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}How do I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.53,0:21:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}你应该帮忙的{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}You can help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我又不住这里{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I don't even live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}首先，我是个男人{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}First, I'm a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.30,0:21:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}第二，我还是客人呢{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Second of all, I'm a guest here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.97,0:22:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}你在看我的日记吗？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Are you reading my diary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}那可是我的隐私{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Told you that was private.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.14,0:22:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我没看{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I didn't read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.21,0:22:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}但看上去你看了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Well, it kind of looked like you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我想找出那些日期{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I was trying to find the dates.{\r}
