Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.25,0:28:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我好久没有这种感觉了{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I haven't felt that way for a long time.{\r}
