Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.62,0:31:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}这样没用的{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}That's not gonna help.{\r}
