Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.88,0:31:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}克莱儿·艾布希尔{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Clare Abshire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.94,0:32:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}她是个艺术工作者{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}She's an artist.{\r}
