Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.20,0:32:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我曾看见她推着婴儿车里的我{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I see her pushing me in the stroller.{\r}
