Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.88,0:33:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}每天都想{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I miss her every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.25,0:33:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我也是{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}So do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.28,0:34:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}亨利{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.65,0:34:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我一生从不想拥有任何东西…{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I never wanted to have anything in my life{\r}
