Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.67,1:38:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我知道{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.56,1:39:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}有时我觉得他会躲在树丛中{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}Sometimes I think he's in the trees...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.26,1:39:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}想着什么时候出来给我个惊喜{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}...deciding when to come out and surprise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.90,1:39:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}当我还是个小女孩时，我经常这样想{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I used to think that when I was a little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.63,1:39:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}他似乎就在我身边，就算他不在的时候{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}That he was always here, even when he wasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.70,1:39:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\b1}我想他一直都在，对吧？{\r}\N{\fnVrinda\fs14\1c&HFFFF00&}I guess he is, isn't he?{\r}

