Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.56,1:25:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnVrinda\fs18\1c&HFFFF00&\i1\be1}♪ Give me your answer, do ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.43,1:25:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnVrinda\fs18\1c&HFFFF00&\i1\be1}♪ I'm half crazy ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.51,1:25:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnVrinda\fs18\1c&HFFFF00&\i1\be1}♪ All for the love of you ♪

